  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup milk",
    "0.66666668653488 cup seasoned bread crumbs",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons dried minced onion",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon rubbed sage",
    "1.5 pounds ground beef",
    "0.5 cup sliced fresh mushrooms",
    "0.25 cup ketchup",
    "2 tablespoons brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon ground mustard",
    "0.5 teaspoon Worcestershire sauce"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "To make the meatloaf: Whisk milk, bread crumbs, eggs, minced onion, salt, and sage together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yUl9y01NVmcVRybN-MIYnnO2p34=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223381-MeltInYourMouthMeatloaf-mfs-step1-0388-da9646b6b117406c8fd7792846d6de0e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223381/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in ground beef and mushrooms until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PiII6qi71tMLeGezdNMqBXgoSO4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223381-MeltInYourMouthMeatloaf-mfs-step2-0390-0c33d008794d4c41bf0c110800f395bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223381/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape mixture into a round loaf. Place loaf into a 5-quart slow cooker. Cover and cook on Low until a meat thermometer reads 160 degrees F (71 degrees C), 5 to 6 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZGYzbnf8ko3kty4ZVT7DlMX9HmU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223381-MeltInYourMouthMeatloaf-mfs-step3-0394-6a0a5ab197a34ac78b06c5f05e85fd44.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223381/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the glaze: Whisk ketchup, brown sugar, mustard, and Worcestershire sauce together in a small bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gC1Y2H3A7YB_HCGA51di89R2bss=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223381-MeltInYourMouthMeatloaf-mfs-step4-0395-29322817bcbe4988a26364a721ff530d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223381/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Open the slow cooker and spoon glaze over the meatloaf. Cover and continue to cook on Low until sauce is heated through, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ivZkG79y6mwCGcUCfEB-ZtzMhx4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223381-MeltInYourMouthMeatloaf-mfs-step5-0428-60f9f36fd6594d958ca66290ca7e5bff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223381/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully use two spatulas to transfer the meatloaf to a serving plate. Cover with foil and let stand for 10 minutes to retain the juices before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6DnZsUpA1dO-lVSKVHcBJViSFwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223381-Melt-In-Your-Mouth-Meatloaf-DDMFS-4X3-525699b08bdb49e09675cb6ea8412cb1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223381/step_06.webp"
    }
